  "prefLabel": "Rev 1801.01 Charitable, educational and other non-profit corporation or association",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1801.01 “Charitable, educational and other non-profit corporation or association” means those entities established and administered for the purpose of promoting and obligated by charter or otherwise, to promote the conservation of natural resources, including the maintaining of land or water areas predominately:\n\n(a) In a natural, scenic, or open condition;\n\n(b) For agricultural, farming, open space or forest use; or\n\n(c) For any other use or condition consistent with the protection of environmental quality.\n\nSource. #5231, eff 9-27-91; ss by #5353, eff 3-12-92; ss by #6692, eff 2-21-98, ss by #8567, eff 2-14-06; ss by #10560, eff 3-28-14; ss by #13867, eff 2-8-24",
